{"synopsis":"In the slums lived a young boy named Ray who lacked emotions.\n\nHe suddenly gained the ability to see \"colors\" that no one else could, and he had the power to control them.\n\nOne day, he lost his shelter, an underpass, and his friends to a magician. He even lost Niles, whom he had believed in and followed.\n\nThe emotionless boy swore to take revenge, beginning his search to regain his emotions.","alternative_title":"The Genius Magician who Sees the Rainbow, Mago prismático genio, 무지개를 보는 천재마법사","author":"Sewer, Ice Coffee","artist":"Kangkang","chapters":[{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"9a7b1ca3-676e-458e-999f-ae61b7f7fc72","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-07-25"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"2dacde94-9db6-488b-b591-056367968cfb","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-07-07"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"f5ad7eb3-4d3d-40ff-bd09-ce24987d606e","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-07-06"},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"f9d524ce-4779-476b-97a0-d59da8dfd23e","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-07-06"},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"02f6d169-9572-489f-8394-d0894c2b8370","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-06-10"},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"9a3596c6-e6bb-4c29-9763-2e20abb3fc3d","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-05-30"},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"542c27f1-a929-4f0b-a6a7-61b496d736a1","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-05-19"},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"81213359-b74e-4d9d-a2e7-e518c0cc68f3","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-05-19"},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":"6319fb3b-b381-44f7-a088-caa360751e67","title":"Chapter 50","date":"2026-05-19"},{"number":"49","chapter":"49","slug":"ea0f2ea4-6616-47ef-9480-0b237029b151","title":"Chapter 49","date":"2025-09-28"},{"number":"48","chapter":"48","slug":"27f74a53-5ef3-4f3e-ac5e-efb86f7d433f","title":"Chapter 48","date":"2025-09-14"},{"number":"47","chapter":"47","slug":"d102c86f-c500-4dbb-9435-e40fa2a1e8ae","title":"Chapter 47","date":"2025-09-12"},{"num